OL,3,GNEWSABoy said Allahu Akbar in school
OL,4,Aattack, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old boy walked into a school
OL,7,Fwith a knife and insect spray and
OL,8,Fstabbed two children in the neck while
OL,9,Fshouting "Allahu Akbar", a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FThe defendant, who cannot be named for
OL,13,Flegal reasons, launched his attack in
OL,14,Ffront of "terrified" children at
OL,15,FKingsbury High School in Brent,
OL,16,Fnorth-west London, on 10 February, the
OL,17,FOld Bailey was told.
OL,19,FThe now 14-year-old allegedly stabbed
OL,20,Fone boy in a classroom before stabbing
OL,21,Fa second boy in the playground.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
